# Netlify routing for this single-page app.
#
# Each real page is served its own copy of the app (about.html, …) with
# status 200. The build writes each copy with that page's title,
# description and canonical link already in it (scripts/seo.mjs), so
# search engines and link previews see the right page. Anything else is
# served 404.html (the app's "Page not found" screen, marked noindex) with
# status 404, so search engines do not index mistyped URLs as real pages.
#
# IMPORTANT: when you add a new page to src/App.jsx, add its path here too
# (and to src/data/pages.js), or it will load fine but report itself to
# search engines as "not found".

# ---- One address for search engines: https://marudyaan.com -------------
# www.marudyaan.com moves visitors (and search rankings) to the bare
# domain. These rules only match requests for that host, so they do
# nothing until the domain's DNS points at Netlify.
https://www.marudyaan.com/*     https://marudyaan.com/:splat    301!
http://www.marudyaan.com/*      https://marudyaan.com/:splat    301!
# The old Netlify address forwards to the domain too.
https://ngo-marudyaan.netlify.app/*   https://marudyaan.com/:splat   301!

/about          /about.html          200
/past-works     /past-works.html     200
/gallery        /gallery.html        200
/get-involved   /get-involved.html   200
/request-help   /request-help.html   200
/donate         /donate.html         200
/contact        /contact.html        200
/privacy        /privacy.html        200

# Our Work is now part of About Us (a #section in the link is kept)
/our-work       /about        301

/*              /404.html            404
